    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Skill Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1600 height=850 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove unnecessary skills and create powerful skill chains to control the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine skill cards to craft your perfect deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moment-to-Moment Decision-Making Leads the Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1000 height=930 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle never stops.<br>In the midst of randomly appearing cards every moment, choose the skill you need most right now.<br>Resources are limited, and opportunities are fleeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Synergy in Card Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1186 height=1022 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is not just about having the strongest cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must quickly judge and combine cards to create powerful chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Decisions Are the Art of Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant judgment, perfected decks.<br>Your choices and your deck are the key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time card selection and tactical action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure of limited resources and spontaneous choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy design based on synergy between cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Skill Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1600 height=850 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/c63b53ba76ab74e474eaf4003a60dace.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove unnecessary skills and create powerful skill chains to control the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine skill cards to craft your perfect deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moment-to-Moment Decision-Making Leads the Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1000 height=930 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/2e12e7c05b59ad6dea58646e655cf9fb.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle never stops.<br>In the midst of randomly appearing cards every moment, choose the skill you need most right now.<br>Resources are limited, and opportunities are fleeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Synergy in Card Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.poster.avif?t=1753888528\" width=1186 height=1022 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.webm?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/6bcbd7e5e923059194f852d4c2d184e1.mp4?t=1753888528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is not just about having the strongest cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must quickly judge and combine cards to create powerful chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Decisions Are the Art of Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant judgment, perfected decks.<br>Your choices and your deck are the key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time card selection and tactical action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure of limited resources and spontaneous choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy design based on synergy between cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Deckstination is a real-time combat and deck-building hybrid. In this action roguelike, players use customized skill decks to overcome enemies in battles. Combine randomly drawn skills to survive intense encounters and take control of the battlefield with your own actions and strategy.",
